app ui-city-builder-board "1.0.0"
"CityBuilderBoard — isometric SimCity-lite: zone buildings on a 12x12 riverside grid with gold + wood, grow population to 12 to win. game-shell + canvas-2d with live input wiring (PLACE_BUILDING/SELECT_BUILD_TYPE), a build-palette in the HUD, per-type economy, and wandering citizens."
;; @capabilities "isometric city building, building placement, population growth, resource management, build-palette UI"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the MAYOR of a riverside plot. Statuses verified 2026-07-30 by
;; a scripted full playthrough driving the real game on the runtime-verify
;; catalog through window.__orbitalVerification (events in, canvas drawables +
;; HUD DOM + bus event log out).
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a SimCity-lite player expects): you zone, the city pays.
;; The pre-built old town (13 seeded buildings) pays taxes EVERY SECOND —
;; per-type income: houses +1g, the farm +3w, mines +3g, the treasury +5g,
;; the library +1g. You spend gold AND wood to place new buildings from the
;; 7-button palette: click a palette button to arm a build type, then click a
;; green cell to build. Green cells are the legal spots for the PENDING type
;; RIGHT NOW — empty, passable, affordable, and (for the mine) on stone.
;; Houses are the growth engine (+2 settlers each; library and barracks +1);
;; every home that goes up moves a new citizen onto the map. Buildings are
;; guarded: occupied cells, water, off-grid clicks and unaffordable picks are
;; dead clicks. Reach 12 population and the city is complete — overlay, board
;; freeze, PLAY_AGAIN resets. Citizens wander one cell per second as pure
;; ambience (they are not selectable — the canvas's only click intent is
;; zoning, so the dead selectedUnitId affordance was removed).
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; MAYOR — "I turn a sleepy riverbank into a thriving town of 12 settlers."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see my whole plot framed on screen — the 12x12
;;      isometric grid (impassable water on the west shore, a road cross, a
;;      stone ridge north-east, dirt flats east), the 13 old-town buildings,
;;      3 wandering citizens, the HUD reading Population 0 / Gold 100 /
;;      Wood 80 / Build house, and a 7-button build palette in the HUD.
;;        WORKS — 144 terrain tiles (12 water), 13 seeded features with both
;;        mines on the stone ridge (7,0)+(11,0), 3 citizens, HUD 0/house with
;;        gold+wood live, 7 cost-labeled palette buttons, 119 green cells;
;;        every descriptor svg/isometric CDN.
;;   2. The palette arms my zoning: I click "Farm" and the Build stat flips to
;;      "farm"; the green buildable highlight recomputes for the newly armed
;;      type (empty + passable + affordable cells only).
;;        WORKS — real DOM click on Farm flipped Build to farm and fired
;;        SELECT_BUILD_TYPE {id,pressed} on the bus (press+release).
;;   3. I place a house on a green grass cell: gold drops 20, wood drops 10,
;;      the house sprite stands on the cell, population rises by 2, a
;;      construction burst flashes on the cell, and a new citizen moves in.
;;        WORKS — house at (0,5): wood 113->103 (-10) and gold 276->256 (-20,
;;        no income tick in the window), pop 0->2, build.svg burst seen, citizens 3->4,
;;        PLACE_BUILDING on the bus.
;;   4. Bad clicks are dead clicks: an occupied old-town cell, a water cell,
;;      and a building I cannot afford change nothing — no gold spent, no new
;;      feature, no population.
;;        WORKS — occupied (1,5) and water (0,0) clicks added no feature and
;;        no pop; after treasury spam drained wood below price, ZERO green
;;        cells lit and the next click was dead.
;;   5. Mines belong on stone: with the mine armed, only stone-ridge cells
;;      light green; clicking grass is a dead click, clicking stone raises
;;      the mine.
;;        WORKS — mine armed: all 14 green cells on the ridge (x>=7,y<=3);
;;        grass (2,8) dead; mine rose on stone (8,0).
;;   6. The city pays taxes: every second, each standing building pays its
;;      per-type income (house +1g, farm +3w, mine +3g, library +1g,
;;      treasury +5g) — the seeded old town pays from boot, so Gold and Wood
;;      tick upward on their own.
;;        WORKS — from boot: +36g and +6w over 2.5s with zero input
;;        (18g/s, 3w/s from the seeded town).
;;   7. Citizens are alive: they wander one cell per second on cycling walk
;;      frames, and every home I place (house/library/barracks) moves a new
;;      citizen onto the map.
;;        WORKS — positions changed over 1.4s, walk-0<->walk-1 urls cycled,
;;        9 citizens on the map by 12 population.
;;   8. The HUD tells the truth: the Build stat renders the armed type as
;;      TEXT (never a parseInt-ed 0), and Population/Gold/Wood live-update
;;      every tick.
;;        WORKS — Build read "house"/"farm"/"mine" as text (format: "text"
;;        on the stat), Population/Gold/Wood live numeric strings.
;;   9. When population reaches 12 the city is complete: "CITY COMPLETE!"
;;      overlay, GAME_END on the bus, taxes stop, placement and palette go
;;      dead — the board freezes.
;;        WORKS — overlay text found, GAME_END {result:won} on the bus, gold
;;        frozen 952->952 over 2.2s, placement dead post-win (animTick now
;;        guards on result=="none" so it can't wipe the overlay).
;;  10. Play Again resets the plot: boot gold/wood, population 0, the 13
;;      seeded buildings, 3 citizens, house armed — and the game plays again.
;;        WORKS — DOM click on Play Again: pop 0, Build house, 13 features +
;;        3 citizens restored, and a fresh house placed (features 14).
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/, generated by
;; tools/asset-workflow svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/{water,grass,road,stone,dirt}.svg — full-cell iso
;;             tiles; water (west shore) is the only impassable terrain.
;;   Features  features/{house,farm,mine,library,barracks,tower,treasury}.svg
;;             static buildings; the same map backs config.assetManifest.features
;;             (placement sprite lookup) and the 13 seeded old-town features.
;;   Units     units/citizen.svg + .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1}.svg frames; the
;;             citizen layer url-rewrites citizen.svg -> citizen.walk-<f%2>.svg
;;             on the 100ms anim tick.
;;   Effects   effects/build.svg — construction burst on placement (ttl 1s).
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg (shell + HUD background — WIRED but a
;;             substrate no-op today: game-shell's AtlasPanel only slices
;;             atlas/spritesheet assets and silently drops url-only svg,
;;             so the texture never renders or fetches; gap reported),
;;             ui/icon-{population,gold,wood}.svg (HUD stat icons — live).
;; ============================================================================

orbital CityBuilderBoardOrbital {
  type CityBuilderBoardError = {
    message : string!
    name : string
    code : string
    stack : string
  }
  type Asset = {
      url : asset
      atlas : string
      sprite : string
      role : string
      category : string
      animations : [string]
      style : string
      variant : string
      dimension : string
      aspect : string
      name : string
      thumbnailUrl : string
    }
  type CityBuilderBoardTilesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    terrain : string
    terrainSprite : Asset
    passable : boolean
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardFeaturesItem = {
    id : string!
    x : number!
    y : number!
    type : string!
    sprite : Asset
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardBuildTypesItem = {
    type : string!
    label : string!
    cost : number!
    woodCost : number!
    pop : number!
    goldRate : number!
    woodRate : number!
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardCitizensItemPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardCitizensItem = {
    id : string!
    position : CityBuilderBoardCitizensItemPosition
    sprite : Asset
    animation : string
    frame : number
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardEffectItem = {
    key : string!
    x : number!
    y : number!
    ttl : number!
  }
  type CityBuilderBoardAssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }

  entity CityBuilderBoardItem [runtime] {
    id : string!
    features : [CityBuilderBoardFeaturesItem]
    citizens : [CityBuilderBoardCitizensItem]
    gold : number = 100
    wood : number = 80
    population : number = 0
    pendingBuildType : string = "house"
    result : "none" | "won" | "lost" = none
    tick : number = 0
    effects : [CityBuilderBoardEffectItem] = []
    validMoves : [CityBuilderBoardCitizensItemPosition] = []
  }

  trait CityBuilderBoardRender -> @rebindable CityBuilderBoardItem [interaction, instance] {
    initial: building

    state building {
      INIT -> building
        (set @entity.gold @config.gold)
        (set @entity.wood @config.wood)
        (set @entity.population 0)
        (set @entity.features @config.features)
        (set @entity.citizens @config.citizens)
        (set @entity.pendingBuildType @config.pendingBuildType)
        (set @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.tick 0)
        (set @entity.effects [])
        (set @entity.validMoves (array/map (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (object/get @tl passable) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (and (== @f.x (object/get @tl x)) (== @f.y (object/get @tl y)))))) 0) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get @tl terrain) "stone")))))))) (fn tl { x: (object/get @tl x), y: (object/get @tl y) })))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      SELECT_BUILD_TYPE -> building when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.pendingBuildType ?id)
        (set @entity.validMoves (array/map (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (object/get @tl passable) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (and (== @f.x (object/get @tl x)) (== @f.y (object/get @tl y)))))) 0) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get @tl terrain) "stone")))))))) (fn tl { x: (object/get @tl x), y: (object/get @tl y) })))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      PLACE_BUILDING -> building when (and (== @entity.result "none") (and (grid/in-bounds { x: ?x, y: ?y } @config.gridWidth @config.gridHeight) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn b (and (== @b.x ?x) (== @b.y ?y))))) 0) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (== (object/get @tl x) ?x) (and (== (object/get @tl y) ?y) (== (object/get @tl passable) false)))))) 0) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (== (object/get @tl x) ?x) (== (object/get @tl y) ?y))))) terrain) "stone"))))))))
        (set @entity.gold (- @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)))
        (set @entity.wood (- @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)))
        (set @entity.features (array/concat @entity.features [{ id: (str/concat "bld-" (array/len @entity.features)), x: ?x, y: ?y, type: @entity.pendingBuildType, sprite: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest features) @entity.pendingBuildType) }]))
        (set @entity.population (+ @entity.population (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) pop)))
        (set @entity.effects (array/concat @entity.effects [{ key: "build", x: ?x, y: ?y, ttl: 10 }]))
        (if (> (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) pop) 0) (set @entity.citizens (array/concat @entity.citizens [{ id: (str/concat "c-" (array/len @entity.citizens)), position: { x: ?x, y: ?y }, sprite: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) "citizen"), animation: "idle", frame: 0 }])) null)
        (set @entity.result (if (>= @entity.population @config.targetPopulation) "won" @entity.result))
        (if (!= @entity.result "none") (emit GAME_END { result: @entity.result }) null)
        (set @entity.validMoves (array/map (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (object/get @tl passable) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (and (== @f.x (object/get @tl x)) (== @f.y (object/get @tl y)))))) 0) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get @tl terrain) "stone")))))))) (fn tl { x: (object/get @tl x), y: (object/get @tl y) })))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      GAME_END -> gameover when (or (== @entity.result "won") (== @entity.result "lost"))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          overlay: { type: game-menu, title: (if (== @entity.result "won") "CITY COMPLETE!" "GAME OVER"), subtitle: (str/concat "Population: " @entity.population), options: [ { id: "again", label: "Play Again", event: "PLAY_AGAIN", variant: "primary" } ] }
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    state gameover {
      PLAY_AGAIN -> building
        (set @entity.gold @config.gold)
        (set @entity.wood @config.wood)
        (set @entity.population 0)
        (set @entity.features @config.features)
        (set @entity.citizens @config.citizens)
        (set @entity.pendingBuildType @config.pendingBuildType)
        (set @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.tick 0)
        (set @entity.effects [])
        (set @entity.validMoves (array/map (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (object/get @tl passable) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (and (== @f.x (object/get @tl x)) (== @f.y (object/get @tl y)))))) 0) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get @tl terrain) "stone")))))))) (fn tl { x: (object/get @tl x), y: (object/get @tl y) })))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    ticks {
      animTick every 100ms
        when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.citizens (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u (object/merge @u { frame: (% (+ (object/get @u frame) 1) 8) }))))
        (set @entity.effects (array/filter (array/map @entity.effects (fn e (object/merge @e { ttl: (- (object/get @e ttl) 1) }))) (fn e (> (object/get @e ttl) 0))))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      resourceIncomeTick every 1s
        when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.tick (+ @entity.tick 1))
        (set @entity.gold (+ @entity.gold (array/sum (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b (* (object/get @b goldRate) (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (== (object/get @f type) (object/get @b type)))))))))))
        (set @entity.wood (+ @entity.wood (array/sum (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b (* (object/get @b woodRate) (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (== (object/get @f type) (object/get @b type)))))))))))
        (set @entity.citizens (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u (let ((nx (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) x) (math/sign (- (math/floor (* (math/random) @config.gridWidth)) (object/get (object/get @u position) x)))) 0 (- @config.gridWidth 1))) (ny (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) y) (math/sign (- (math/floor (* (math/random) @config.gridHeight)) (object/get (object/get @u position) y)))) 0 (- @config.gridHeight 1)))) (object/merge @u { position: { x: @nx, y: @ny }, animation: "walk" })))))
        (set @entity.validMoves (array/map (array/filter @config.tiles (fn tl (and (object/get @tl passable) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.features (fn f (and (== @f.x (object/get @tl x)) (== @f.y (object/get @tl y)))))) 0) (and (>= @entity.gold (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) cost)) (and (>= @entity.wood (object/get (array/first (array/filter @config.buildTypes (fn b (== (object/get @b type) @entity.pendingBuildType)))) woodCost)) (or (!= @entity.pendingBuildType "mine") (== (object/get @tl terrain) "stone")))))))) (fn tl { x: (object/get @tl x), y: (object/get @tl y) })))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: md, justify: between, children: [ { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Population", value: @entity.population, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-population.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-population", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Wood", value: @entity.wood, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-wood.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-wood", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Build", value: @entity.pendingBuildType, format: "text" } ] }, { type: control-grid, kind: "actions", buttons: (array/map @config.buildTypes (fn b { id: (object/get @b type), label: (str/concat (object/get @b label) (str/concat " · " (object/get @b cost))), variant: "secondary" })), actionEvent: SELECT_BUILD_TYPE } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: PLACE_BUILDING, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f sprite) })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.citizens (fn u { type: draw-sprite, id: (object/get @u id), position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (object/get @u sprite) { url: (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-city-builder-board/svg/isometric/units/citizen.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") }) })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    emits {
      SELECT_BUILD_TYPE -> external {
        id : string!
        pressed : boolean
      }
        @description "Emitted by the HUD build palette (control-grid actionEvent) with {id, pressed} when the mayor arms a build type"
        @tier "domain"
      PLACE_BUILDING -> external {
        x : number!
        y : number!
      }
        @description "Emitted by the canvas (tileClickEvent) with {x,y} when the mayor zones a cell"
        @tier "domain"
      GAME_END -> external {
        result : string!
      }
        @description "Emitted when the city reaches its population target (won)"
        @tier "domain"
    }

    config {
      className : string = ""
        @label "Class Name"
        @description "className prop"
        @tier "presentation"
      isLoading : boolean = false
        @label "Is Loading"
        @description "Loading state indicator"
        @tier "presentation"
      error : CityBuilderBoardError
        @label "Error"
        @description "Error state (UiError)"
        @tier "presentation"
      gridWidth : number = 12
        @label "Grid Width"
        @description "Number of columns in the tile grid"
        @tier "presentation"
      gridHeight : number = 12
        @label "Grid Height"
        @description "Number of rows in the tile grid"
        @tier "presentation"
      gold : number = 100
        @label "Starting Gold"
        @description "Gold the mayor starts each game with"
        @tier "presentation"
      wood : number = 80
        @label "Starting Wood"
        @description "Wood the mayor starts each game with"
        @tier "presentation"
      targetPopulation : number = 12
        @label "Target Population"
        @description "Population to reach for victory"
        @tier "presentation"
      pendingBuildType : string = "house"
        @label "Pending Build Type"
        @description "Initially armed building type in the palette"
        @tier "presentation"
      scale : number = 0.3
        @label "Scale"
        @description "Canvas render scale"
        @tier "presentation"
      unitScale : number = 0.6
        @label "Unit Scale"
        @description "Unit draw-size multiplier"
        @tier "presentation"
      buildTypes : [CityBuilderBoardBuildTypesItem] = [{ type: "house", label: "House", cost: 20, woodCost: 10, pop: 2, goldRate: 1, woodRate: 0 }, { type: "farm", label: "Farm", cost: 15, woodCost: 5, pop: 0, goldRate: 0, woodRate: 3 }, { type: "mine", label: "Mine", cost: 25, woodCost: 0, pop: 0, goldRate: 3, woodRate: 0 }, { type: "library", label: "Library", cost: 30, woodCost: 10, pop: 1, goldRate: 1, woodRate: 0 }, { type: "barracks", label: "Barracks", cost: 40, woodCost: 15, pop: 1, goldRate: 0, woodRate: 0 }, { type: "tower", label: "Tower", cost: 35, woodCost: 10, pop: 0, goldRate: 0, woodRate: 0 }, { type: "treasury", label: "Treasury", cost: 50, woodCost: 20, pop: 0, goldRate: 5, woodRate: 0 }]
        @label "Build Types"
        @description "Placeable building types: gold cost, wood cost, settlers (pop), and per-second income rates."
